WEBVTT

01:30.500 --> 01:34.500
Just give the order. We'll charge up
north and catch them unawares

01:34.500 --> 01:37.100
Then you can ascend the throne

01:38.500 --> 01:41.100
Princess Ruining is the woman
I love most

01:41.500 --> 01:45.100
Unless it can't be helped, I won't
clash with the Emperor head-on

01:46.500 --> 01:51.100
Once I'm the Princess' husband, the
throne will be mine sooner or later

01:51.500 --> 01:53.100
Why should I be impatient?

01:53.500 --> 01:57.100
Marquis, you are wise!
You are wise!

01:57.500 --> 02:01.100
Come and drink
the Number One Scholar Tea,

02:01.500 --> 02:05.100
all of you who are going
to sit the imperial exams

02:05.500 --> 02:08.100
It'll improve your memory and
give you a facile imagination

02:08.500 --> 02:12.100
This tea is concocted by my brother,
the divine physician

02:14.500 --> 02:16.100
I'm going to join the queue

02:17.500 --> 02:21.100
You're putting all your money there.
I'm a physician too

02:21.500 --> 02:24.100
How I spend my money
doesn't concern you

02:25.500 --> 02:27.100
She's sick!

02:31.500 --> 02:33.100
Remember to take your medicine

02:34.500 --> 02:36.100
Physician Mei, it's my turn

02:36.500 --> 02:39.100
-I need your help
-What is it regarding?

02:41.500 --> 02:44.100
You're turning to me
because your husband can't do it?

02:45.500 --> 02:48.100
I don't mean that.
Come in

02:52.500 --> 02:54.100
Ma Ruyi!

02:57.500 --> 02:59.100
Aren't you stupid!

02:59.500 --> 03:01.100
Put it down

03:02.500 --> 03:04.100
Chop that stuff

03:07.500 --> 03:10.100
Just take a few pieces at a time

03:13.500 --> 03:15.100
Coming!

03:17.500 --> 03:19.100
Carry a stool here for me

03:24.500 --> 03:27.100
Pound my legs for me

03:28.500 --> 03:30.100
Ma Ruyi

03:30.500 --> 03:32.100
Get me a cup of tea

03:32.500 --> 03:36.100
-Ma Ruyi, pound my legs for me!
-Ma Ruyi, get me a cup of tea!

03:37.100 --> 03:40.100
That's enough! Ma Ruyi, sit down
over there and take a rest

03:43.500 --> 03:47.100
Keep quiet, the two of you.
Ma Ruyi, take a rest over there!

03:48.500 --> 03:50.100
I can take a break

03:50.500 --> 03:54.100
Ma Ruyi, my child moved his bowels.
Come and clean up after him

04:04.500 --> 04:10.100
Everybody, this is our secret weapon.
Her gongfu is peerless!

04:10.500 --> 04:16.100
The moment robbers hear her name,
they'll pee in their pants

04:16.500 --> 04:20.100
She's none other than the first
woman constable, Golden Swallow!

04:23.500 --> 04:27.100
Ma Ruyi, stop pulling a long face.
Cheer up!

04:32.500 --> 04:38.100
Golden Swallow is going to perform
an item called Invincible Thunderbolt

04:43.500 --> 04:49.100
You can be assured your valuables
will reach their destination safely

04:49.500 --> 04:53.100
Fu Qi Armed Escort Agency
has a guaranteed reputation

04:53.500 --> 04:59.100
Next, Golden Swallow will show us
no weapon can touch her

05:06.500 --> 05:09.100
Breaking a boulder with her chest

05:16.500 --> 05:19.100
Give her a big hand!

05:27.500 --> 05:31.100
-Which of you is Wu Fuqi?
-That's me

05:31.500 --> 05:35.100
Impressive! I want you to
escort something for me

05:37.500 --> 05:42.100
My name is Jiang Dahua.
I run a bank

05:43.500 --> 05:49.100
Boss Jiang, be assured all your goods
will be delivered safely

05:50.500 --> 05:55.100
-Where do you want the goods delivered?
-Panlong Hill

06:00.500 --> 06:04.100
Old Geezer!
Old Geezer!

06:04.500 --> 06:06.500
Old Geezer!
Come out!

06:07.500 --> 06:12.100
Your Obedience Spell
has got me in big trouble

06:13.500 --> 06:17.100
The problem doesn't lie
with the spell

06:17.500 --> 06:23.100
You are in this state
because of your personality

06:23.500 --> 06:26.100
Some people are by nature obedient

06:26.500 --> 06:31.100
So they don't find the
Obedience Spell a problem

06:31.500 --> 06:36.100
You, on the other hand,
have to temper yourself...

06:36.500 --> 06:40.100
be it as a human
or an immortal

06:41.500 --> 06:44.100
The leopard never changes
its spots

06:44.500 --> 06:48.100
No matter how hard I try, I can never
become an obedient person

06:48.500 --> 06:53.100
I know I offended you in the past
but I've suffered enough

06:55.500 --> 07:00.100
Do you really think
I'm that petty?

07:01.500 --> 07:06.100
Please lift the spell for me then.
I'll be so grateful to you

07:07.500 --> 07:09.100
I have to consider

07:10.500 --> 07:13.100
Haven't you tortured me enough?

07:13.500 --> 07:18.100
If you don't lift the spell,
I'm staying put

07:20.500 --> 07:25.100
How could you be so perverse!

07:25.500 --> 07:29.100
You don't want me to pester you?
Lift the spell!

07:29.500 --> 07:31.100
Fine.
I'm scared of you

07:33.500 --> 07:35.100
Really!

07:38.500 --> 07:40.100
Read this carefully

07:42.500 --> 07:45.500
This is the prescription
which will lift the spell

07:46.100 --> 07:47.100
Prescription?

07:50.500 --> 07:53.100
"A stalk of red plum blossom
stands proudly in the snow

07:53.500 --> 07:56.100
A goodbye kiss is given
amidst flowers in clusters

07:56.500 --> 07:59.100
The chirping of birds
is heard

07:59.500 --> 08:03.100
At the end of the cave
stands a maple"

08:03.500 --> 08:06.100
The poem is not bad, eh?

08:07.500 --> 08:10.100
This is no prescription
but a poem

08:10.500 --> 08:13.100
If you don't understand the poem,

08:14.500 --> 08:17.100
you have to keep on
being obedient

08:17.500 --> 08:21.100
You know I know nothing about poems
yet you deliberately test me with one

08:21.500 --> 08:25.100
I have no patience to make guesses.
Just tell me what it's all about

08:25.500 --> 08:32.100
That won't do. You agreed to let me
cast the Obedience Spell on you...

08:32.500 --> 08:35.100
in exchange for Mei Shouquan's life

08:35.500 --> 08:42.100
Now you want me to lift the spell
just like that. Isn't that unfair?

08:42.500 --> 08:45.100
You'll be the death of me!

08:47.500 --> 08:50.100
I'll be shaken to death
before you die

08:52.500 --> 08:56.100
Why don't you look at this
from a different angle?

08:56.500 --> 09:02.100
You can consider it a joy of life!

09:02.500 --> 09:08.100
You're teasing me and enjoying
yourself at my expense!

09:08.500 --> 09:11.100
You have no intention
of helping me!

09:11.500 --> 09:14.100
If you choose to think that way,
there's nothing I can do

09:14.500 --> 09:19.100
If you want the spell to be lifted,
you have to follow certain rules

09:19.500 --> 09:22.100
If you don't want to rack
your brains, give it back to me!

09:22.500 --> 09:24.100
Wishful thinking!

09:24.500 --> 09:27.100
You think too lowly of me!
I won't be daunted

09:29.500 --> 09:32.100
You have no respect
for the old!

09:33.500 --> 09:36.100
Chief, we looked everywhere
but she's nowhere to be found

09:36.500 --> 09:39.100
This is so worrisome!
Where has Ma Ruyi gone?

09:41.500 --> 09:44.100
Just where has Ma Ruyi gone?

09:45.500 --> 09:49.100
Since she can't be found,
we'll set off ourselves!

09:49.500 --> 09:54.100
Without Miss Ma's protection, we won't
be able to make it up to Panlong Hill

09:54.500 --> 09:59.100
Given our skills, there's no way
we can escort the goods up the hill

10:00.500 --> 10:03.100
Many highly skilled exponents
are found in the hill...

10:03.500 --> 10:07.100
including one who feeds on
human flesh!

10:09.100 --> 10:12.100
I heard there's a scorpion there
whose poison is so potent...

10:12.500 --> 10:15.100
that it can make you suffer
a fate worse than death

10:16.500 --> 10:23.100
I heard they have a torture instrument
which tears off your flesh

10:23.500 --> 10:27.100
I heard they like to hang you upside
down and drain you of your blood

10:27.500 --> 10:29.100
That's enough

10:29.500 --> 10:35.100
This deal is worth 50 taels of silver.
If we give it up, what will we live on?

10:35.500 --> 10:40.100
50 taels isn't enough to pay for
the funeral expenses of the six of us

10:40.500 --> 10:45.100
That's enough! Stop boosting the morale
of others and putting ourselves down

10:47.500 --> 10:52.100
There's no way you can skip this trip
unless the sky falls on you

10:52.500 --> 10:54.500
Don't even think of sneaking off

10:55.500 --> 10:59.500
Go and get ready!
Hurry!

11:01.500 --> 11:03.100
You guys are really...

11:03.500 --> 11:05.500
You still can't find Sister Ma?

11:06.100 --> 11:08.100
I think she's avoiding us

11:08.500 --> 11:12.100
Serves you right for making her
perform this and that

11:12.500 --> 11:15.100
Can't you stop doing things
like that?

11:15.500 --> 11:18.100
Nothing you say now helps!

11:19.500 --> 11:22.100
Why don't you come with us?

11:22.500 --> 11:26.100
But I don't know gongfu
and won't be of any help

11:26.500 --> 11:31.100
I know you don't know gongfu.
But you can act as if you do

11:31.500 --> 11:33.100
Me?

11:33.500 --> 11:36.100
You want me to pass myself off
as Sister Ma again?

11:36.500 --> 11:39.100
-No deal!
-You can do it

11:39.500 --> 11:43.100
You're experienced
and very good at it

11:43.500 --> 11:47.100
Have you forgotten?
You even had me fooled the other time

11:50.500 --> 11:54.100
Very well, I'll help you.
I'll disguise myself one more time

11:57.500 --> 12:01.100
With Ma Ruyi here,
who'd dare have designs on me?

12:17.500 --> 12:20.100
Long time no see.
Are you doing fine?

12:20.500 --> 12:24.100
Far from it.
I'm about to be tortured to death

12:25.500 --> 12:27.100
What's going on?

12:27.500 --> 12:31.100
I've been a security guard, nanny,
bodyguard and what-have-you

12:31.500 --> 12:34.100
But I don't get paid at all

12:34.500 --> 12:36.100
You did all that
of your own volition?

12:38.500 --> 12:41.100
I'm actually suffering
from an affliction

12:41.500 --> 12:43.100
Affliction?

12:44.500 --> 12:47.100
Someone cast an obedience spell
on me

12:47.500 --> 12:51.100
Obedience spell?
Never heard of that

12:51.500 --> 12:56.100
A person under this spell
will do everything she's told to do

12:56.500 --> 12:58.100
But that's terrible

12:58.500 --> 13:02.100
If I say: Ma Ruyi, slap your right
cheek with your right hand...

13:05.500 --> 13:08.100
Ma Ruyi, stop it!

13:09.500 --> 13:13.100
Now you know how pitiful I am

13:13.500 --> 13:15.100
You poor thing

13:15.500 --> 13:18.100
What can I do to help you?

13:18.500 --> 13:20.100
I've got a prescription

13:20.500 --> 13:24.100
I'll get it filled for you

13:24.500 --> 13:28.100
This isn't an ordinary prescription
but a poem

13:28.500 --> 13:30.100
The spell lies within it

13:32.500 --> 13:36.100
Given Wei Delu's literary talent,
why don't you go to him?

13:36.500 --> 13:41.100
Wei Delu has always been arrogant.
He only acts upon what you say

13:41.500 --> 13:44.100
If you approach him,
he will say yes

13:44.500 --> 13:46.100
Very well

13:46.500 --> 13:48.100
Thank you, Princess

13:48.500 --> 13:51.100
But I've got to go into hiding

13:51.500 --> 13:54.100
I'm beat carrying out
their commands

13:55.500 --> 14:01.100
Just leave the matter to me. Ma Ruyi,
you must be tired. Go and rest

14:07.500 --> 14:09.100
Ma Ruyi!

14:13.500 --> 14:15.100
Ma Ruyi

14:15.700 --> 14:17.700
Princess, what brings you here?

14:18.000 --> 14:23.600
As the new top scholar, you should act
prudently. Gossip is a fearful thing

14:25.000 --> 14:28.000
-I know
-Then you should restrain yourself

14:30.300 --> 14:37.900
I have a clear conscience.
I don't care what other people say

14:40.800 --> 14:45.800
There's one exception. She only has
to say the word and I'll do it

14:46.300 --> 14:48.900
-Who's that?
-You

14:49.300 --> 14:50.900
I haven't finished

14:52.300 --> 14:56.900
This is both your strength
and your fatal weakness

14:57.300 --> 14:59.900
Princess, I've always been like that

14:59.900 --> 15:03.500
I won't become over-cautious
just because I'm an official now

15:03.900 --> 15:05.500
That's being hopelessly stupid

15:08.100 --> 15:10.700
I know it's not easy to make you
change your personality

15:12.100 --> 15:13.700
Be careful in future

15:15.100 --> 15:17.700
I have a favour to ask of you

15:19.100 --> 15:20.700
Please speak

15:22.400 --> 15:25.000
I've got a poem here
which I don't understand

15:25.100 --> 15:27.700
You're more talented than me.
Could you take a look?

15:35.100 --> 15:38.700
"A stalk of red plum blossom
stands proudly in the snow

15:39.100 --> 15:43.700
A goodbye kiss is given
amidst flowers in clusters

15:45.100 --> 15:48.700
The chirping of birds is heard

15:49.100 --> 15:54.700
At the end of the cave
stands a maple"

15:59.100 --> 16:02.700
Official Wei,
why are you so quiet?

16:15.100 --> 16:18.700
Do you really want me to do it?

16:20.100 --> 16:22.700
You've unravelled
the secret of the poem?

16:42.100 --> 16:46.700
I'm unable to reciprocate
your deep feelings for me

17:04.100 --> 17:08.700
I'm ready to fulfill your wish

17:12.100 --> 17:13.700
What are you trying to do?

17:17.100 --> 17:22.700
Close your eyes and I'll do it

17:28.100 --> 17:29.700
What are you doing?

17:30.100 --> 17:34.700
This is outrageous!
How dare you be rude to me!

17:35.100 --> 17:39.700
Why did you slap me?
The poem says a passionate kiss

17:41.100 --> 17:45.700
I asked you about the poem on someone's
behalf. It has nothing to do with me

17:56.100 --> 17:59.700
Princess, since you've expressed
your feelings through the poem,

18:00.100 --> 18:01.700
why purposely make
a mystery of things?

18:05.100 --> 18:07.700
She's had me baffled

18:10.100 --> 18:13.700
It's as if my heart is floating
in the sea

18:14.100 --> 18:18.700
I've lost my way
and I am totally helpless

18:19.100 --> 18:23.700
Could you tell me
if the Princess loves me?

18:24.100 --> 18:26.700
Do I have a place in her heart?

18:29.100 --> 18:33.700
If I have a place in her heart,
pop your head out and give a nod

18:47.100 --> 18:49.700
It's too tiring for you
to pop your head out?

18:50.100 --> 18:55.700
Tell you what.
If the Princess loves me,

18:57.100 --> 18:58.700
keep still

19:05.100 --> 19:09.700
I knew it. I'm a fine-looking guy
and a Number One Scholar

19:10.100 --> 19:13.700
The princess has no reason
not to like me

19:22.100 --> 19:25.700
Did the Princess show me that poem
because she loves me?

19:26.100 --> 19:31.700
If she wrote that poem...
keep still as before

19:36.100 --> 19:37.700
I knew it

19:38.100 --> 19:42.700
Out of shyness, she claimed she asked
me about the poem on another's behalf

19:43.100 --> 19:48.700
Am I right? I should have held her
tight and kissed her passionately

19:49.100 --> 19:54.700
To think that I rinsed my mouth
and acted so bashfully

19:55.100 --> 20:00.700
I was such a failure,
such a failure!

20:01.100 --> 20:02.700
A passionate kiss

20:07.100 --> 20:09.700
A kiss full of passion

20:11.100 --> 20:13.700
Thanks for pointing the way
out to me

20:14.100 --> 20:17.700
I won't forget your kindness.
Cheers!

20:20.100 --> 20:22.700
You drink some too.
That's it

20:25.100 --> 20:30.700
Wait! I couldn't move my head
in time. Don't get the wrong idea

20:31.100 --> 20:33.700
You're simply too impatient

20:37.100 --> 20:39.700
-Brother Fuqi, I'm very tired
-Hang on! Hang on!

20:40.100 --> 20:43.700
Once we pass through here,
we'll be safe

20:48.100 --> 20:49.700
Halt!

21:01.100 --> 21:02.700
What's this for?

21:03.100 --> 21:06.700
What a silly question!
This is a robbery

21:08.100 --> 21:10.700
Do you think
we came here to take a leak?

21:11.100 --> 21:15.700
Leave your valuables behind
or your head will roll!

21:16.100 --> 21:17.700
Robbery?

21:18.100 --> 21:22.700
Take a good look before
you even think of robbing us!

21:23.100 --> 21:25.700
Look who's behind

21:26.100 --> 21:28.700
-I'm Golden Swallow
-Golden Swallow?

21:29.100 --> 21:30.700
That's her

21:31.100 --> 21:35.700
Tell me your names.
If you let me pass,

21:36.100 --> 21:39.700
I will repay your kindness

21:40.100 --> 21:44.700
Since Golden Swallow asked,
we should show her some respect

21:45.100 --> 21:47.700
In that case, move aside

21:49.100 --> 21:51.700
Let us pass.
Hurry

21:52.100 --> 21:55.700
Thank you.
Let's go!

21:56.100 --> 21:57.700
Set off!

21:58.100 --> 22:01.700
Stop there!
She isn't the real Golden Swallow

22:03.100 --> 22:07.700
Who said that? Step out!
I'll show you what I'm capable of

22:08.100 --> 22:09.700
I said that

22:11.100 --> 22:15.700
-Teacher?! Long time no see
-You're no disciple of mine!

22:16.100 --> 22:19.700
-This Golden Swallow is an imposter?
-Surround them

22:22.100 --> 22:23.700
Freeze!

22:26.100 --> 22:28.700
Teacher, weren't you doing time?

22:31.100 --> 22:33.700
Money makes the mare go

22:35.100 --> 22:40.700
I had someone grease Shi Yaoqian's
palm. Thinking I was mad, he freed me

22:41.100 --> 22:44.700
He freed you? That's great!
Congratulations!

22:45.100 --> 22:47.700
I wish you good health.
May all go well for you

22:48.100 --> 22:49.700
I'll buy you tea
one of these days

22:50.100 --> 22:53.100
I'm off!
Come on, let's go

22:53.100 --> 22:56.700
Stop there! I vowed to kill you
and Golden Swallow in revenge!

23:13.100 --> 23:15.700
I vowed to kill you
and Golden Swallow in revenge

23:17.100 --> 23:18.700
Meet your doom!

23:21.100 --> 23:25.700
I've recently mastered a skill which
makes my fist an invincible force

23:26.100 --> 23:30.700
My fist is now so strong that
it can make a hole in the ground

23:31.100 --> 23:33.700
You'd better not come over

23:34.100 --> 23:37.700
Don't I know your capability? I can
twist your hand off with one finger

23:38.100 --> 23:41.700
Grab the things
and take the woman too

23:42.100 --> 23:43.700
Just a minute

23:45.100 --> 23:48.700
Since you won't believe me,
I'll show you what I'm capable of

23:49.100 --> 23:53.700
-I'm sorry, Teacher
-Come on! Come on!

24:08.100 --> 24:10.700
Why did it lose power
at the last minute?

24:20.100 --> 24:21.700
Brother Fuqi,
are you all right?

25:04.100 --> 25:07.700
Attack me!
Come on!

25:17.100 --> 25:19.700
This is what you get for
not believing me

25:22.100 --> 25:24.700
Mei Shouquan, step out here!

25:27.100 --> 25:29.700
If you are a man, step out!

25:30.100 --> 25:32.700
I'll show you what I'm capable of

25:33.100 --> 25:35.700
He doesn't dare step out.
This shows he's guilty!

25:38.100 --> 25:41.700
Why are you training your voice
here so early in the morning?

25:42.100 --> 25:44.700
Train my voice?
Who's so free to do that?

25:45.100 --> 25:49.700
That brother of yours
has got my wife pregnant

25:51.100 --> 25:54.700
Your wife is expecting?
That's great

25:57.100 --> 25:58.700
Listen!

25:59.100 --> 26:06.700
Gold Tooth, what makes you say that
my brother got your wife pregnant?

26:08.100 --> 26:11.700
My wife has admitted to it.
So how can it not be true?

26:13.100 --> 26:15.700
Brother, let me ask you

26:16.100 --> 26:20.700
You didn't get his wife
pregnant, did you?

26:21.100 --> 26:24.700
Yes, I admit to it

26:25.100 --> 26:27.700
If not for me, how would
his wife have got pregnant?

26:28.100 --> 26:30.700
He admitted to it himself

26:31.100 --> 26:35.700
Why are you shouting? Haven't you and
your wife always longed for a child?

26:36.100 --> 26:37.700
Your wish is granted

26:40.100 --> 26:45.700
Whether we have a child or not
is none of your business

26:47.100 --> 26:48.700
Stop it!

26:49.100 --> 26:52.700
Why are you assaulting
our benefactor?

26:53.100 --> 26:54.700
I haven't settled my score
with you

26:55.100 --> 26:57.700
Don't get upset
or it'll affect the baby

26:59.100 --> 27:02.700
The child isn't the flesh
and blood of the Meis, is it?

27:03.100 --> 27:07.700
Don't talk rot! Physician Mei
treated me for infertility

27:08.100 --> 27:12.700
Then I got pregnant.
I'm carrying Gold Tooth's child

27:14.100 --> 27:16.700
The truth is finally out!

27:18.100 --> 27:21.700
I know the child is mine.
I'm mad because...

27:22.100 --> 27:25.700
you approached him instead of me
for help - I'm a physician too

27:27.100 --> 27:31.700
So what if you're a physician? How
can your skills be compared to his?

27:32.100 --> 27:33.700
In what way am I inferior to him?

27:34.100 --> 27:39.700
You treated our neighbour, Xu Buliang,
for years but to no effect

27:40.100 --> 27:45.700
All Physician Mei did was stick a needle
in him and the problem was solved

27:46.100 --> 27:48.700
He and his wife even had a child

27:49.100 --> 27:51.700
To think you'd side with an outsider
and not me

27:52.100 --> 27:55.700
Gold Tooth,
what are you screaming for?

27:56.100 --> 28:01.700
If you were highly skilled, your wife
wouldn't have approached me for help

28:03.100 --> 28:07.700
Who says I'm not highly skilled?
I'll be honest with you

28:08.100 --> 28:10.700
I just didn't want my wife
to get pregnant

28:11.100 --> 28:12.700
Really?

28:13.100 --> 28:15.700
So it was premeditated

28:17.100 --> 28:19.700
Just what are you up to?

28:21.100 --> 28:23.700
-I'll talk! I'll talk!
-Out with it!

28:24.100 --> 28:29.700
If you're able to reproduce,
I won't get to take another wife

28:33.100 --> 28:34.700
I see

28:35.100 --> 28:36.700
Serves you right

28:43.100 --> 28:48.700
I'll be honest with you. As long as
I live, I won't let you take a concubine

28:49.100 --> 28:53.700
Don't even think of doing that.
Let's go home!

28:59.100 --> 29:02.700
Mrs Gold Tooth, remember to take
your medicine to keep the baby safe

29:03.100 --> 29:06.700
My brother can effect a miraculous cure
and bring the dying back to life

29:07.100 --> 29:11.700
If you're trying for triplets
or quads, go to him

29:15.100 --> 29:17.700
Boss, count your goods

29:24.100 --> 29:25.700
Thanks

29:26.100 --> 29:28.700
This is your payment

29:33.100 --> 29:37.700
This is the payment for our first deal.
I'll treat you to a feast tonight

29:40.100 --> 29:44.700
How did you manage to summon
the force in your right fist again?

29:45.100 --> 29:49.700
No idea. In my anxiety to protect you,
I unconsciously executed the skill

29:50.100 --> 29:54.700
-Can you do that again now?
-No idea. Let me try it out on you

29:56.100 --> 29:58.700
Don't worry, I won't use
a lot of force

30:06.100 --> 30:07.700
Official Wei!

30:09.100 --> 30:10.700
Official Wei!

30:19.100 --> 30:21.700
"Princess, I knew you'd be back

30:22.100 --> 30:25.700
Since our last parting,
I've had many sleepless nights

30:26.100 --> 30:28.700
Take five steps forward
and look right"

30:32.100 --> 30:36.700
1,2,3,4,5!

30:41.100 --> 30:44.700
"I don't know how to express
my regret to you

30:45.100 --> 30:48.700
Turn left, take five steps back
and turn around"

30:49.100 --> 30:50.700
Turn left

31:00.100 --> 31:02.700
"Latest invention.
Look up!"

31:11.100 --> 31:13.700
"I'm sorry, Princess"

31:19.100 --> 31:22.700
"I love you, Princess"

31:40.100 --> 31:42.700
That was a great feeling, eh?

31:43.100 --> 31:45.700
I spent a lot of money
to invent that

31:49.100 --> 31:52.700
I never had the chance
to express my love for you

31:53.100 --> 31:58.700
I also know your father, His Majesty,
is going to marry you to Ouyang Xiaotian

31:59.100 --> 32:01.700
I hope you'll understand
my feelings for you

32:03.100 --> 32:06.700
Official Wei, I'm very grateful
for the concern you show me

32:07.100 --> 32:09.700
-But...
-But what?

32:11.100 --> 32:14.700
Princess, would you like to come up
and sit here?

32:16.100 --> 32:22.700
I... and Ouyang Xiaotian were childhood
sweethearts. We love each other

32:23.100 --> 32:28.700
I regard you as a bosom friend.
I'm afraid you've got the wrong idea

32:29.100 --> 32:33.700
You only regard me as a friend
and confidant?

32:35.100 --> 32:37.700
I don't believe you.
I don't believe you

32:38.100 --> 32:41.700
Have you forgotten
what happened in the desert?

32:42.100 --> 32:44.700
I spoke from the bottom
of my heart

32:46.100 --> 32:49.700
I will marry Ouyang Xiaotian
and no other

32:50.100 --> 32:54.700
You're saying you only love Ouyang
Xiaotian and will marry no other?

32:56.100 --> 32:59.700
But before you go through
the wedding ceremony with him,

33:00.100 --> 33:02.700
I can still express my love
for you

33:04.100 --> 33:07.700
Princess,
you've got to give me a chance

33:10.100 --> 33:13.700
You said you'd marry Ouyang Xiaotian
and no other

33:15.100 --> 33:17.700
Before you go through
the wedding ceremony with him,

33:18.100 --> 33:21.700
I should be given the chance
to express my love for you

33:24.100 --> 33:27.700
Unless... unless you tell me
you dislike me

33:29.100 --> 33:32.700
Go on, say you dislike me now

33:33.100 --> 33:34.100
Say it

33:35.100 --> 33:40.700
With your talent, I'm sure
you'll be able to find a better girl

33:41.100 --> 33:42.700
I'm off

34:03.100 --> 34:07.700
Bad news! Physician Mei,
you're wanted by the authorities!

34:13.100 --> 34:14.700
That's him

34:15.100 --> 34:16.700
-What's up?
-Someone reported you

34:17.100 --> 34:18.700
-Who?
-It was me

34:19.100 --> 34:20.700
What did you report me for?

34:21.100 --> 34:23.700
My wife became dumb
after you treated her

34:24.100 --> 34:25.700
Your wife lost her voice?

34:26.100 --> 34:30.700
After taking the medicine
you prescribed her

34:31.100 --> 34:37.700
An expectant mother might lose her voice
during the ninth month of pregnancy

34:38.100 --> 34:41.700
Your wife might be weak
so this happened to her early

34:42.100 --> 34:44.700
I'm not to blame

34:45.100 --> 34:48.700
Whether you're responsible or not,
let the yamen decide that

34:50.100 --> 34:54.700
Just a minute.
I have two patients waiting for me

34:55.100 --> 34:57.700
Can I see them
before I leave with you?

34:58.100 --> 35:01.700
You still want to treat patients? You
aren't content till you kill somebody?

35:02.100 --> 35:04.700
You think you're that great?

35:05.100 --> 35:08.700
Do you think all patients will die
unless you treat them?

35:14.100 --> 35:16.700
He made you lose your voice.
What are you doing here?

35:17.100 --> 35:19.700
You've maligned Physician Mei

35:20.100 --> 35:23.700
-You can talk?
-Gold Tooth, you took us for a ride

35:24.100 --> 35:26.700
I thought you said
she couldn't talk

35:27.100 --> 35:29.700
She couldn't talk in the morning
but now...

35:30.100 --> 35:34.700
-Stick out your tongue!
-Mei Shouquan, why is she able to talk?

35:37.100 --> 35:38.700
The reason is very simple

35:39.100 --> 35:41.700
Why did your wife
suddenly lose her voice?

35:42.100 --> 35:46.700
Her passages have been blocked
due to a lack of exercise...

35:47.100 --> 35:49.700
and the foetus pressing on them

35:50.100 --> 35:52.700
How did she recover her voice?

35:53.100 --> 35:57.700
In her anxiety to get here,
she ran very fast,

35:58.100 --> 36:02.700
thus raising her body temperature
and clearing the passages

36:03.100 --> 36:06.700
You don't even know that?
Some physician you are!

36:07.100 --> 36:10.700
You took us for a ride!
Come with us to the yamen!

36:11.100 --> 36:15.700
Officer, we're sorry for
the trouble caused

36:16.100 --> 36:17.700
Please leave

36:20.100 --> 36:22.700
Apologize to Physician Mei

36:23.100 --> 36:24.700
He was just lucky

36:26.100 --> 36:28.700
Lucky, my foot!
I'll kill you

36:29.100 --> 36:34.700
You should exercise more but not
too hard. Kicking his butt will do

36:35.100 --> 36:38.700
But don't kick too high
or it'll affect the baby

36:39.100 --> 36:41.700
It'll be a pity
if you lose the baby

36:42.100 --> 36:44.700
You truly are a divine physician

36:45.100 --> 36:47.700
Let's go!
Move it!

36:52.100 --> 36:55.700
-My respects to you, Princess
-Dispense with formalities

36:56.100 --> 36:58.700
Wei Delu explained the poem

36:59.100 --> 37:01.700
How can the Obedience Spell
be lifted?

37:03.100 --> 37:05.700
When you kiss passionately

37:07.100 --> 37:08.700
I beg your pardon?

37:09.100 --> 37:13.700
The spell will be lifted
when the man who loves you...

37:14.100 --> 37:17.700
and whom you are in love with
kiss passionately

37:19.100 --> 37:23.700
Where am I going to find a man
whom I love and who loves me?

37:24.100 --> 37:28.700
You've got to ask yourself
if there's someone you love

37:31.100 --> 37:32.700
I don't know

37:34.100 --> 37:38.700
You didn't say there wasn't anyone.
This means that person does exist

37:39.100 --> 37:42.700
How to tell
if I love a person?

37:43.100 --> 37:46.700
When someone you love falls ill,
you'll feel anxious

37:47.100 --> 37:49.700
When he's unhappy,
you'll feel sad for him

37:50.100 --> 37:51.700
When he's in danger,
you'll feel worried for him

37:52.100 --> 37:55.700
His emotions will affect
your moods

37:58.100 --> 38:01.700
-You have someone in mind?
-No

38:02.100 --> 38:04.700
-Ma Ruyi, who's your sweetheart?
-Mei Shouquan

38:06.100 --> 38:09.700
Physician Mei?
You have good judgment

38:10.100 --> 38:11.700
Don't tell anyone this

38:12.100 --> 38:16.700
I'm in no mood to gossip about others.
I feel vexed enough as it is

38:19.100 --> 38:21.700
Princess, you're troubled by
affairs of the heart too?

38:22.100 --> 38:26.700
When I approached Wei Delu
to explain the poem,

38:27.100 --> 38:29.700
he thought I was giving him a hint

38:31.100 --> 38:34.700
Wei Delu thought you wanted to share
a kiss with him? The cheek of him!

38:35.100 --> 38:39.700
But knowing how hurt he feels,
I don't hold it against him

38:40.100 --> 38:44.700
I regard him as a confidant. There
are no romantic feelings involved

38:45.100 --> 38:49.700
Besides, Father has betrothed me
to Ouyang Xiaotian

38:51.100 --> 38:55.700
Pardon me for asking you this. Do you
and Ouyang Xiaotian love each other?

38:57.700 --> 39:02.700
There's only Xiaotian in my heart and
I believe his feelings for me are true

39:03.100 --> 39:06.700
-But...
-But what?

39:07.100 --> 39:11.700
I find he's been hiding
many things from me

39:12.100 --> 39:14.700
I feel I understand him
less and less

39:16.100 --> 39:19.700
-What are you going to do?
-I don't know

39:20.100 --> 39:22.700
I'll take things as they come

39:25.700 --> 39:29.700
Affairs of the heart
can really drive one crazy

39:37.100 --> 39:40.700
Affairs of the heart...

39:41.100 --> 39:43.700
really drives one crazy

39:45.100 --> 39:46.700
Not necessarily so

39:47.100 --> 39:52.700
If you meet someone whom you love
and who loves you,

39:53.100 --> 39:56.700
the feeling of joy
is indescribable

39:57.100 --> 40:00.700
Shuangxi, have you ever kissed
passionately with Fu?

40:01.100 --> 40:07.700
Of course not! We behave
within the bounds of propriety

40:08.100 --> 40:11.700
I was just asking.
Don't get so worked up

40:12.100 --> 40:15.700
What about you and Master Mei?

40:16.100 --> 40:18.700
Do you behave within
the bounds of propriety too?

40:19.100 --> 40:21.700
Why do all of you keep thinking
Shou and I are an item?

40:22.100 --> 40:26.700
The onlooker sees the game best
while the gamester is muddle-headed

40:27.100 --> 40:29.700
I'm muddle-headed?
Surely not?

40:30.100 --> 40:34.700
I can't talk to you anymore. My sis
is waiting for me at home. I'm off

40:45.100 --> 40:47.700
A stalk of red plum blossom
stands quietly in the snow

40:48.100 --> 40:51.700
A goodbye kiss is given
amidst flowers in clusters

40:52.100 --> 40:55.700
The chirping of birds is heard

40:56.100 --> 40:58.700
At the end of the cave
stands a maple

41:01.100 --> 41:04.700
-Ruyi, this poem...
-You can tell its meaning?

41:05.100 --> 41:07.700
Yes but it's out of the question

41:08.100 --> 41:10.700
You can do it
unless you don't want to

41:11.100 --> 41:14.700
I'd like to but I'm afraid the spirit
is willing but the flesh is weak

41:15.100 --> 41:17.700
Are you a man?
Have you no guts at all?

41:18.100 --> 41:21.700
I have guts
but this poem is so well-written

41:22.100 --> 41:24.700
I don't know
how to continue it

41:25.100 --> 41:27.700
Fool! I'm not asking you
to continue the poem

41:28.100 --> 41:29.700
What do you want me to do?

41:30.100 --> 41:31.700
You'll be the death of me!

41:33.100 --> 41:35.700
Just what do you want me to do?
Say it

41:41.100 --> 41:43.700
Your neck is very long.
Are you all right?

41:51.100 --> 41:54.700
Look at your lips!
Do you need to see a physician?

42:02.100 --> 42:06.700
Shou, the meaning of the poem
is a passionate kiss

42:07.100 --> 42:09.700
I have to kiss passionately
to lift the spell

42:12.100 --> 42:13.700
I'll do it myself

42:27.100 --> 42:31.700
You're not allowed to kiss!
You're not allowed to kiss!

42:36.100 --> 42:38.700
You're not allowed to kiss!

42:50.100 --> 42:51.700
Here I go

43:09.100 --> 43:11.100
Pay up! Pay up!

43:12.100 --> 43:14.700
Just because you guys say so?

43:15.100 --> 43:16.700
Pay up!

43:17.100 --> 43:21.700
I'll lose face if I do that.
Not only will you not get paid,

43:22.100 --> 43:26.700
if you dare leak this out,
I'll give you a thrashing

43:27.100 --> 43:31.700
If you think you're better than me,
step forward and take me on!

43:32.100 --> 43:35.700
Go away!
Go away!

43:37.100 --> 43:40.700
I'm done for this time.
What shall I do?

43:42.100 --> 43:44.700
I can't do this

43:47.100 --> 43:48.700
Kiss! Kiss!

43:49.100 --> 43:50.700
Who's there?

43:55.100 --> 43:57.700
What is meant by
a passionate kiss?

44:01.100 --> 44:03.100
Subtitled by Transtar Media Services
